is a small village with small demands; normally, you can find Clagen somewhere
in the forest preparing to surprise, capture and kill jackalopes for supper.
With sweat streaking down his soot-covered body, Clagen gives you a broad grin
as he masterfully pounds a lump of metal into a flat sheet.
~
