Nicano the Healer~
A solemn dwarf is here skillfully mixing some potions.
~
   In flowing white robes, Nicano is constantly at work in his workshop.
Nicano must prepare all sorts of potions and drugs necessary for the daily
functioning of this village; poisonous drugs to enhance weapons, and healing
potions for those injuries that commonly occur while hunting.  When Nicano
is not mixing a brew, he can be found in the forest searching for elusive
jao berries, harvesting fragrant kolsin branches or just peacefully relaxing
under a tree.
~
