Daphne's daughter Rohnna~
A lovely young dwarf is here fixing a bed for you to sleep in for the night.
~
   Rohnna is a lovely woman who's seductive charm and beauty is patterned
after her mother's.  She has no interest in adventure and exploration which
had interested her mother, she is just content to stay here in the village
and to lead a happy life.
   Rohnna's helps her mother with the chores.  Actually, she does most of
the cooking and cleaning while her mother entertains the guests here at this
guest house.  If someone needs a place to stay for the night, Rohnna and
Daphne can provide them with a bed for the night.
~
